WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:04.570
Rock and roll.
It really is a magical thing.

00:00:04.637 --> 00:00:06.439 line:0%
♪ (ROCK AND ROLL MUSIC PLAYS) ♪

00:00:06.506 --> 00:00:07.239
This is it.

00:00:07.673 --> 00:00:10.610
It's not just any hall of fame.
It's the fucking--

00:00:10.677 --> 00:00:12.746
ALL: Rock and Roll Hall of Fame.

00:00:13.813 --> 00:00:15.314
(CROWD CHEERS)

00:00:16.148 --> 00:00:18.318
Make some noise for my man,
LL Cool J.

00:00:18.418 --> 00:00:20.920
I wanna thank all of you.
(YELLS) Mama, I made it!

00:00:23.323 --> 00:00:24.123 line:0%
DREW BARRYMORE:

00:00:24.591 --> 00:00:27.760
<i> Beauty and the Beat</i>
blew the doors of my life off!

00:00:27.793 --> 00:00:29.929
We love you and you will
always be in our hearts.

00:00:29.995 --> 00:00:32.264
It's just unbelievable.
(MIMICS EXPLOSION)

00:00:32.331 --> 00:00:34.867
Carole King is the
greatest songwriter of all time.

00:00:34.934 --> 00:00:36.436
She's inspired us all so much.

00:00:36.636 --> 00:00:38.804
Oh, thank you. Thank you.

00:00:38.871 --> 00:00:40.973
(CROWD CHEERS)

00:00:41.307 --> 00:00:44.344
Being Black in America.
It's not as easy as it looks.

00:00:44.811 --> 00:00:46.946
(CROWD LAUGHS)

00:00:47.647 --> 00:00:50.015
I went to
every single record company,

00:00:50.115 --> 00:00:51.885
and you know
what they said, right?

00:00:52.051 --> 00:00:53.552
"That shit is trash!"

00:00:54.119 --> 00:00:56.856
I, for not one second,
changed my course.

00:00:56.956 --> 00:00:58.691
Now that's rock and roll.

00:00:59.225 --> 00:01:04.030 line:0%
Tina Turner is who we're
here tonight to celebrate.

00:01:06.165 --> 00:01:07.199 line:0%
SIR PAUL MCCARTNEY:

00:01:07.466 --> 00:01:10.135
<i>This band is one of the greatest
 rock and roll bands.</i>

00:01:10.202 --> 00:01:12.205
Thank you all very much
for hanging out with us.

00:01:12.705 --> 00:01:15.075
♪ (MUSIC CONTINUES) 

00:01:16.375 --> 00:01:19.245
You're simply the best!

